  id: freelance-2
  title: Signal Lost
  description: A verified exchange contract generated from today's network conditions. Familiar infrastructure, a new layout of defenses, and payment on a clean extraction.
  company: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3979b1c18fff72b47a14017949de0f0e, type: 2}
  network: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25c4e5da1c02d094db8c98790db4959f, type: 2}
  client: EXCHANGE // verified escrow
  tag: FREELANCE / REPEATABLE
  objective: Recover records at Dev terminal, Audit terminal, and Research vault.
  condition: 'Below 75% trace: +100 cr / +20 XP. Each optional archive: +100 cr / +15 XP; all three pay XP.'
  aftermath: A quiet freelance job closes. The exchange has fresh work, and the network keeps changing.
