  lore:
  - id: freelance/2/0
    title: Maintenance testimony
    company: AEGIS SYSTEMS
    contract: Signal Lost
    text: An Aegis contractor logged an objection to a surveillance request. The objection was denied, but the timestamp proves someone knew before deployment.
  - id: freelance/2/1
    title: An unofficial record
    company: AEGIS SYSTEMS
    contract: Signal Lost
    text: Aegis lists this relay as retired. Its maintenance channel now carries volunteer dispatches, clinic appointments, and messages home.
  - id: freelance/2/2
    title: What the archive kept
    company: AEGIS SYSTEMS
    contract: Signal Lost
    text: 'A security analyst left a note in the archive: Protection means giving people somewhere safe to go. It does not mean following them there.'
